The depth loop of cert_quad in ladder.py drives mpmath's TanhSinh rule
(get_nodes, sum_next, guess_degree) in the loop of
`QuadratureRule.summation` in mpmath 1.3.0 (https://github.com/mpmath/mpmath,
mpmath/calculus/quadrature.py), released under the BSD 3-Clause License, with
a different stopping test, a deeper cap, a check for non-finite values and an
error raised on failure. The mpmath notice is reproduced here:

